nt or postpartum women hospitalized with ARFI divided by the annual number of live births\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"was applied, using bootstrapping\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The percentages of hospitalizations among the total number of pregnant or postpartum women with ARFI or influenza ARFI were assumed the same\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"were markedly lower than that during other years (p<0.05)\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}